Hi {Owner},

I build catalogue sites and ordering tools for distributors and wholesalers around {City}. On the {Business Name} site I couldn't search the catalogue, see delivery cut-offs, or open a trade account without a printed credit form.

I built a sample before asking for your time: a searchable catalogue with a sign-in for trade pricing, an online account application, a page per branch with counter hours, delivery zones and cut-offs, and a project quote desk that takes a material list, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I move it to your domain and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, changes and catalogue updates. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and your inside sales manager work this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
